      "claim": "Fairtrade International (and other major fair‑trade bodies) certify only products that belong to a defined list of categories such as coffee, tea, cocoa, bananas, cotton, gold and other raw commodities.",
      "evidence": "Official Fairtrade International product‑category list (https://www.fairtrade.net/product‑categories) and WFTO membership criteria show no inclusion of finished electronic devices.",
