      "reason_rejected": "Products marketed as ‘ethical’ or ‘conflict‑free’ (e.g., Framework, Fairphone) are not certified under the recognized fair‑trade schemes; without an official fair‑trade label they do not satisfy the strict definition of a ‘fair‑trade’ laptop."
